### Add inventory
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/adjust
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuId": 1,
  "warehouseCode": "MAIN",
  "changeQuantity": 100,
  "reason": "鏈熷垵鍏ュ簱"
}

### Create sales order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales-orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "warehouseCode": "MAIN",
  "paidAmount": 300,
  "items": [
    { "skuId": 1, "quantity": 10, "unitPrice": 35 }
  ]
}

### Confirm sales order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sales-orders/1/confirm
